{"Color palette":"色板","Lit tiles (every 5th) are safe: floats of any color share them and no captures happen there.":"点亮的图块（每 5 个）是安全的：任何颜色的浮标共享它们，并且那里不会发生捕获。","After a full lap, floats climb their colored approach. The final crown needs an exact roll (unless bounce-back is on).":"完成一整圈后，浮子沿其彩色进路攀升。最终的皇冠需要精确掷出（除非开启反弹）。","Tiles bearing a lit lantern are safe: floats of any color may rest there together, and no capture can happen.":"带有点亮灯笼的瓦片是安全的：任何颜色的漂浮物都可以停在那里，并且不会发生捕获。","After a full lap, floats turn into their colored Grand Approach. Reach the pavilion crown with an exact roll.":"完成一整圈后，浮子进入其彩色大进路。以精确掷出到达亭阁皇冠。","Player":"玩家","Crown {n} float(s)":"加冕{n}个浮子","{n} captures":"{n} 捕获","Win with {n}+ captures":"以 {n}+ 捕获获胜","Win without capturing":"无需捕获即可获胜","☁ synced":"☁ 已同步","☁ saving…":"☁ 保存中…","☁ offline":"☁ 离线","Captions for meaningful audio":"重要音频字幕","Camera":"镜头","Theme":"主题","Visual theme. Cosmetics never alter rules or hazards.":"视觉主题。化妆品永远不会改变规则或危害。","Pause":"暂停","Undo":"撤销","Hint":"提示","Left-handed controls":"左手操作","The CVD palette uses blue/gold separation; player identity also uses shapes and labels.":"CVD调色板使用蓝色/金色分离；玩家身份也使用形状和标签。","Timing assistance (longer AI pauses, slower banners)":"计时辅助（AI 暂停时间较长，横幅速度较慢）","Replay tutorial lessons":"重玩教程课程","Auto":"自动","Top":"顶部","Low":"低","↺ Resume saved game":"↺ 恢复保存的游戏","{n}/40 stages complete":"{n}/40级完成","40 festival stages":"40 个节日阶段","One shared race each day":"每天一场共享比赛","Saved game restored.":"保存的游戏已恢复。","Could not restore the saved game.":"无法恢复已保存的游戏。","Practice Match":"练习赛","Daily Circuit":"每日赛道","Journey":"旅程","Challenge":"挑战","Lesson":"课程","Local Table":"本地表","Set up":"设置","Players":"玩家","AI difficulty":"AI难度","Floats per player":"每个玩家的浮点数","Rule variants":"规则变体","Exact finish (overshoot is wasted)":"精确完成（过冲被浪费）","Processions (blockades)":"游行（封锁）","Lantern safe tiles":"灯笼安全瓷砖","Players at this table":"此桌的玩家","Pass-and-play: everyone shares this device. Undo is allowed between turns.":"传递并播放：每个人共享该设备。回合之间允许撤