se all local progress, settings stay. This cannot be undone.":"擦除所有本地进度，保留设置。此操作无法撤消。","Progress erased.":"进度已清除。","Race four floats from your workshop around the Grand Circuit. A full lap earns the right to climb your Grand Approach — crown all four floats in the pavilion to win.":"从你的工作室中派出四辆花车绕大赛道比赛。跑完一圈即可获得攀登 Grand Approach 的权利——将展馆内的所有四个花车加冕即可获胜。","Kindling":"火种","Roll a 6 to move a float from the workshop onto your start tile. A 6 also grants an encore roll — but three 6s in a row are overkindled and end your turn.":"投掷 6 即可将车间中的花车移动到您的起始板块上。 6 也可以进行一次安可检定——但是连续三个 6 会过度点燃并结束你的回合。","Lantern tiles":"灯笼瓷砖","Captures":"捕获","Land exactly on a rival float on an ordinary tile to send it back to its workshop.":"准确地落在普通瓷砖上的竞争对手浮标上，将其送回其车间。","Processions":"游行","Two of your floats on one ordinary tile form a wall: rivals can neither land on it nor pass it.":"一块普通瓷砖上的两个浮标形成一堵墙：对手既不能降落在上面也不能通过它。","The Approach":"该方法","Controls":"控制","{confirm} roll/confirm · arrows switch float · {undo} undo · {hint} hint · {camera} camera · {board} board text · {pause} pause. Gamepad: ✕/A confirm, ○/B cancel, ☰ pause.":"{confirm}滚动/确认·箭头切换浮动·{undo}撤消·{hint}提示·{camera}相机·{board}板文本·{pause}暂停。游戏手柄：✕/A 确认，○/B 取消，☰ 暂停。","Achievement unlocked: {name}":"成就解锁：{name}","Journey {n}":"旅程 {n}","Practice":"练习","Be first to crown {n} float(s).":"率先加冕{n}个浮标。","First to {n} captures wins the stage.":"首先以{n}占领者获胜。","Win the race with at least {n} captures.":"以至少 {n} 捕获赢得比赛。","Win without capturing any rival float.":"在不捕获任何对手浮标的情况下获胜。","Crown all your floats first. Lantern schedule: {n} rounds.":"首先加冕你所有的浮子。灯笼日程：{n}轮。","Crown all your floats first.":"首先加冕你所有的浮子。","{n}-round limit":"{n}-轮限制","No turn limit":"无回合限制","{name} begins — roll!":"{name} 开始——滚！","Your turn — roll!":"轮到你了——滚！","{name} to roll…":"{name} 滚动…","No moves — you must pass.":"无步可走 — 您必须跳过。","{name} has no moves.":"{name} 没有动作。","Rolled {n} — choose a float.":"轧制 {n} — 选择浮动。","{name} is choosing…":"{name} 正在选择……","Float {n}: kindle!":"浮点{n