d can be resumed.":"离开游戏？单人进度已保存并可以恢复。","That float cannot use this roll.":"该浮体不能使用该卷。","Today: won · score {score}":"今天：获胜·得分 {score}","Today: played · score {score}":"今天：打过·得分 {score}","exact finish":"精确完成","bounce finish":"弹跳完成","processions on":"游行","no processions":"没有游行","lantern tiles":"灯笼砖","dark circuit":"暗电路","no safe tiles":"没有安全瓷砖","yes — counts for records":"是 — 计入记录","no — practice does not affect rating":"否——练习不影响评级","hints available, undo allowed":"可用提示，允许撤消","hints available":"可用提示","Won":"已获胜","Lost":"失败","Exact finish at the crown":"冠部的精确光洁度","Bounce-back finish":"反弹完成","Processions block rivals":"游行阻挡对手","No processions":"没有游行","Lantern tiles are safe":"灯笼砖是安全的","No safe tiles":"没有安全瓷砖","Captures on":"吃子开启","Captures off":"吃子关闭","Victory":"胜利","Game over":"游戏结束","Race your floats around the festival circuit. First to crown all four wins.":"你的花车在节日赛道上竞速。第一个获得全部四场胜利的人。","▶ Play":"▶ 开始游戏","Learn":"教学","Interactive lessons":"互动课程","Unranked, undo allowed":"无排名，允许撤销","Challenges":"挑战","Constrained goals":"约束目标","Profile":"个人资料","Achievements":"成就","Leaderboards":"排行榜","How to Play":"游戏方法","Settings":"设置","Back":"返回","Start":"开始","Learn the Circuit":"学习电路","Board state (accessible text)":"棋盘状态（无障碍文本）","Objective":"目标","Turn":"回合","Progress":"进度","Rules":"规则","Roll the festival die":"滚节死","Roll":"掷骰","Pass":"跳过回合","Paused":"已暂停","Resume":"继续","Restart":"重新开始","Leave Game":"离开游戏","Done":"完成","Audio":"音频","Graphics":"图形","Accessibility":"无障碍","Results":"结算","Watch Replay":"观看重播","Retry":"重试","Close":"关闭","Daily":"每日","All-time":"历史最佳","Board State":"棋盘状态","Are you sure?":"你确定吗？","Cancel":"取消","Confirm":"确认","Lantern Pavilion":"灯笼亭","Jade Garden":"翡翠花园","Ember Court":"余烬宫廷","Moonlight Dock":"月光码头","Blossom Fête":"花宴","Kindling a Float":"点燃漂浮物","Your floats begin in the workshop. Roll a 6 — a full kindle — to send one onto the circuit. The festival die is scripted for this lesson.":"你的花车从车间开始。掷 6（完整的 kindle）即可将一个送入赛道。节日模具是为本课程编写的。","Roll the festival die.":"滚节死。","You rolled a 6! Choose a float to kindle it onto your start tile.":"你掷出了 6！选择一个漂浮物将其点燃到您的起始图块上。","Well done — a kindled float also grants an encore roll.":"干得好——点燃的浮标还可以进行安可卷。","Around the Circuit":"环绕电路","Floats travel the full circuit. Your rival will take turns with you.":"浮标行进整个回路。你的对手会轮流和你一起。","Roll the die.":"掷骰子。","Kindle a float onto the circuit.":"将浮子点燃到电路上。","Encore! Roll again.":"安可！再掷一次。","Move your float along the circuit.":"沿着电路移动浮标。","Your rival now takes a turn. Turns alternate unless a 6 grants an encore.":"你的对手现在轮到你了。轮流交替，除非 6 允许加演。","Lantern Tiles":"灯笼瓷砖","A rival float waits on the lantern tile ahead. Roll.":"一个对手的花车停在前方的灯笼格上。掷骰。","Move onto the lantern tile — you will share it peacefully.":"移至灯笼图块上 — 您将和平地分享它。","See? Both floats share the lantern tile. Safe tiles never capture.":"看到了吗？两个花车共用灯笼瓦。安全瓷砖永远不会捕获。","The Capture":"捕获","Land on a rival float on an ordinary tile to send it all the way back to its workshop.":"落在一块普通瓷砖上的竞争对手的漂浮物上，将其一路送回其车间。","A rival float rests three tiles ahead, unguarded. Roll.":"一个对手的花车停在前方三格处，无人防守。掷骰。","Land exactly on it to send it home!":"准确地落在它上面，将它送回家！","Captured! Rival floats return to their workshop and must be kindled again.":"被击落了！对手的浮空艇会返回工坊，必须重新点燃。","Two of your floats on one ordinary tile form a procession. Rivals can neither land on it nor pass it.":"一块普通瓷砖上的两个花车形成一个游行队伍。对手既不能登陆也不能越过它。","Roll, then bring your floats together.":"滚动，然后将漂浮物放在一起。","Move the rear float onto its companion (tile 6).":"将后浮子移动到其同伴上（图块 6）。","A procession! Now roll again for your rival to feel it… actually, feel free to move on.":"一场游行！现在再次掷骰，让你的对手感受一下……其实，你可以随意继续。","Move any float. Remember: rivals cannot cross your procession.":"移动任何浮动体。请记住：竞争对手无法跨越您的队伍。","Processions are walls. Break yours up when it blocks your own plans.":"游行队伍是墙。当你的计划阻碍了你的计划时，就分手吧。","The Grand Approach":"大方法","Your float is on the approach, three steps from the crown. Roll.":"您的浮标已接近，距顶部三步。卷。","An exact 3 — guide it to the crown!":"精确的 3——引导它到皇冠！","Crowne